      "writtenOn": "2026-07-27T03:04:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, this implementation was intentional.\n`findStateSensorPDR()` was intended to find state sensors PDR, and its caller will handle empty result as `ResourceNotFound`. Please check at here: \nhttps://github.com/openbmc/pldm/blob/6e343540efde7d074932880a49b9c8a11ffe0e2d/pldmd/dbus_impl_pdr.cpp#L37\n\nIn this case, aborting one malformed record would hide the other valid records.",
      "parentUuid": "96b1bbf0_85f703e9",
      "revId": "f236270d148db89aeb0f8e5443104e25f42e2000",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "48451b05_20b72846",
        "filename": "common/utils.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 132,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002810
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-24T23:32:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "entity_type is a fixed field, so this is the same every iteration. Hoist it --\n`if (pdr.entity_type !\u003d entityID) continue;` before the foreach -- so a\nnon-matching PDR skips the walk.",
      "revId": "f236270d148db89aeb0f8e5443104e25f42e2000",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
